TIPS:

This page summarizes the catalog. To list every model of this provider, search
for its ID; add the image or video filter to narrow the list to one medium.

Examples:
        bild search {{.ID}}
        bild search -v {{.ID}}

To list the models of one vendor, search for the vendor's name with a filter.

Examples:
{{range .Footer.VendorExamples}}        bild search {{.Filter}} {{.Vendor}}
{{end}}
